WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.716 --> 00:00:13.756
Doing the same workout every week, like a push day? Save it as a routine, and next time it's ready to go in one tap. No setting it up again.

2
00:00:14.116 --> 00:00:15.076
Here's how.

3
00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:18.394
On Home, tap Build a routine.

4
00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:21.466
Give it a name, like Push day.

5
00:00:21.817 --> 00:00:23.897
Then tap the Next button.

6
00:00:24.504 --> 00:00:28.184
Now search for an exercise, and tap its Add button.

7
00:00:28.548 --> 00:00:30.788
Add overhead press the same way,

8
00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.233
and tricep pushdowns.

9
00:00:35.925 --> 00:00:38.805
When you have them all, tap the Done button.

10
00:00:39.159 --> 00:00:43.959
Tap the plus or minus buttons to set how many sets each exercise gets.

11
00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:47.677
That's it, your routine is saved. Head back to Home.

12
00:00:48.107 --> 00:00:50.747
Next time, just tap it to start your workout.
